"Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "First, we import the necessary packages:\n"
msgstr "Pertama, kita import pakej yang diperlukan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Then, we make the $M_2$ operator:\n"
msgstr "Kemudian, kita buat operator $M_2$:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
