#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The QPE algorithm uses a controlled-$U$ gate. So, now that we have an $M_2$ "
"circuit, we need to make it a *controlled*-$M_2$ circuit:\n"
msgstr ""
"Algoritma QPE menggunakan gate controlled-$U$. Jadi, sekarang kita sudah ada"
" litar $M_2$, kita perlu menjadikannya litar *controlled*-$M_2$:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/computer-"
"science/shors-algorithm/extracted-"
"outputs/5bf4f10d-5d52-406d-b62d-ad4a8d366c02-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/computer-"
"science/shors-algorithm/extracted-"
"outputs/5bf4f10d-5d52-406d-b62d-ad4a8d366c02-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we have our controlled-$U$ gate. But in order to run the Quantum Phase "
"Estimation algorithm, we'll need controlled-$U^2$, controlled-$U^4$, up to "
"controlled-$U^{2^{m-1}}$, where $m$ is the number of qubits used to estimate"
" the phase. The more qubits, the more precise the phase estimation will be. "
"We'll use $m=8$ control qubits for our phase estimation procedure. So, we "
"need:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kini kita ada gate controlled-$U$. Tetapi untuk menjalankan algoritma "
"Quantum Phase Estimation, kita memerlukan controlled-$U^2$, "
"controlled-$U^4$, sehingga controlled-$U^{2^{m-1}}$, di mana $m$ ialah "
"bilangan qubit yang digunakan untuk menganggar fasa. Lebih banyak qubit, "
"lebih tepat penganggaran fasa. Kita akan menggunakan $m=8$ qubit kawalan "
"untuk prosedur penganggaran fasa kita. Jadi, kita perlukan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"M_{a^{2^k}}|y\\rangle \\equiv |a^{2^k} y \\bmod N \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"M_{a^{2^k}}|y\\rangle \\equiv |a^{2^k} y \\bmod N \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the index $k$, with $0 \\le k \\le m-1 = 7$, corresponds to the "
"control qubit. Now let's calculate $a^{2^k}\\bmod N $ for each value of "
"$k$:\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana indeks $k$, dengan $0 \\le k \\le m-1 = 7$, sepadan dengan qubit "
"kawalan. Jom kita kira $a^{2^k}\\bmod N$ untuk setiap nilai $k$:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Since $a^{2^k} \\bmod N = 1$ for $k \\ge 2$, all of the corresponding "
"operators ($M_8$ and up) are equivalent to the identity. So, we only need to"
" construct one more matrix, $M_4.$\n"
msgstr ""
"Memandangkan $a^{2^k} \\bmod N = 1$ untuk $k \\ge 2$, semua operator yang "
"sepadan ($M_8$ ke atas) bersamaan dengan identiti. Jadi, kita hanya perlu "
"membina satu lagi matriks, iaitu $M_4.$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Note:** This simplification only works here because the order of $2 \\bmod"
" 15 $ is $4$. Once $k=2$ (so $2^k = 4$), every subsequent power of the "
"operator is the identity. In general, for larger numbers $N$ or different "
"choices of $a$, you cannot skip constructing the higher powers. This is one "
"reason why this is considered a *toy example*: the small numbers allow "
"shortcuts that wouldn’t work for larger cases.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Nota:** Penyederhanaan ini hanya berfungsi di sini kerana peringkat $2 "
"\\bmod 15$ ialah $4$. Setelah $k=2$ (jadi $2^k = 4$), setiap kuasa operator "
"seterusnya adalah identiti. Secara umum, untuk nombor $N$ yang lebih besar "
"atau pilihan $a$ yang berbeza, anda tidak boleh melangkau pembinaan kuasa "
"yang lebih tinggi. Inilah salah satu sebab mengapa ini dianggap *contoh "
"mainan*: nombor kecil membenarkan jalan pintas yang tidak akan berfungsi "
"untuk kes yang lebih besar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/computer-"
"science/shors-algorithm/extracted-"
"outputs/ea4fc641-e97c-400d-a761-5f67a0b7d65e-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/modules/computer-"
"science/shors-algorithm/extracted-"
"outputs/ea4fc641-e97c-400d-a761-5f67a0b7d65e-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "And as before, we make it a *controlled*-$M_4$ operator:\n"
msgstr "Dan seperti sebelum ini, kita jadikannya operator *controlled*-$M_4$:\n"

