#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We see four clear peaks at `00000000`, `01000000`, `10000000`, and "
"`11000000`, with some counts in other bitstrings due to noise in the quantum"
" computer. We'll ignore these and keep only the dominant four by imposing a "
"threshold: only counts above this threshold are considered a true signal "
"above the noise.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita dapat melihat empat puncak jelas pada `00000000`, `01000000`, "
"`10000000`, dan `11000000`, dengan beberapa kiraan dalam rentetan bit lain "
"disebabkan oleh hingar dalam komputer kuantum. Kita akan mengabaikannya dan "
"hanya menyimpan empat yang dominan dengan menetapkan ambang batas: hanya "
"kiraan melebihi ambang ini yang dianggap isyarat sebenar di atas hingar.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "4. Post-process {#4-post-process}"
msgstr "4. Proses semula {#4-post-process}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For Shor's algorithm, quite a lot of the algorithm is performed classically."
" So, we'll put the rest of it in the \"post-processing\" step, after we've "
"gotten our measurements from the quantum computer. Each of the measurements "
"above can be converted into integers, which, after we divide by $2^m$, are "
"our approximations for $\\frac{k}{r}$, where $k$ is random each time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk algoritma Shor, sebahagian besar algoritma dilaksanakan secara klasik."
" Jadi, kita akan letak selebihnya dalam langkah \"pemprosesan semula\", "
"selepas kita mendapat pengukuran dari komputer kuantum. Setiap pengukuran di"
" atas boleh ditukar kepada integer, yang setelah dibahagi dengan $2^m$, "
"merupakan anggaran kita untuk $\\frac{k}{r}$, di mana $k$ adalah rawak "
"setiap kali.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Conclusion {#conclusion}"
msgstr "Kesimpulan {#conclusion}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After going through the module, you may be struck with a new appreciation of"
" the brilliance of Peter Shor to have come up with such a clever algorithm. "
"But hopefully you've also reached a new level of understanding of its "
"deceptive simplicity. Although the algorithm may seem impressively (or "
"intimidatingly) complex, if you break it down into each step of logic and go"
" through it slowly, you, too, will be able to run Shor's algorithm.\n"
msgstr ""
"Setelah melalui modul ini, anda mungkin terpukau dengan kecemerlangan Peter "
"Shor yang telah mencipta algoritma yang begitu bijak. Tapi semoga anda juga "
"telah mencapai tahap pemahaman baru tentang kesederhanaan yang mengelirukan "
"ini. Walaupun algoritma ini mungkin kelihatan sangat (atau menakutkan) "
"kompleks, jika anda memecahkannya kepada setiap langkah logik dan melaluinya"
" secara perlahan, anda juga akan dapat menjalankan algoritma Shor.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"While we're far from using this algorithm to factor numbers like RSA1024, "
"our quantum computers are getting better every day, and once a threshold "
"called *fault tolerance* is reached, then algorithms such as these will be "
"soon to follow. It's an exciting time to be learning about quantum "
"computing!\n"
msgstr ""
"Walaupun kita masih jauh daripada menggunakan algoritma ini untuk "
"memfaktorkan nombor seperti RSA1024, komputer kuantum kita semakin baik "
"setiap hari, dan apabila ambang yang dipanggil *toleransi kerosakan* "
"dicapai, algoritma seperti ini akan segera menyusul. Ini adalah masa yang "
"menarik untuk belajar tentang pengkomputeran kuantum!\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Problems {#problems}"
msgstr "Masalah {#problems}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Critical concepts: {#critical-concepts}"
msgstr "Konsep kritikal: {#critical-concepts}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Modern cryptographic systems rely on the classical difficulty of factoring "
"large integers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sistem kriptografi moden bergantung pada kesukaran klasik untuk memfaktorkan"
" integer besar.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Modular arithmetic — including the structures $\\mathbb{Z}_N$ and "
"$\\mathbb{Z}_N^*$ — provides the mathematical foundation for Shor’s "
"algorithm.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aritmetik modular — termasuk struktur $\\mathbb{Z}_N$ dan $\\mathbb{Z}_N^*$ "
"— menyediakan asas matematik untuk algoritma Shor.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The problem of factoring an integer $N$ can be reduced to the problem of "
"finding the order of a number modulo $N$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Masalah memfaktorkan integer $N$ boleh diturunkan kepada masalah mencari "
"peringkat suatu nombor modulo $N$.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Quantum order finding uses quantum phase estimation techniques to determine "
"the period of the function $a^x \\mod N$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pencarian peringkat kuantum menggunakan teknik penganggaran fasa kuantum "
"untuk menentukan tempoh fungsi $a^x \\mod N$.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Shor’s algorithm consists of a classical–quantum hybrid workflow that "
"selects a base, performs quantum order finding, and then classically "
"computes the factors from the result.\n"
msgstr ""
"Algoritma Shor terdiri daripada aliran kerja hibrid klasik-kuantum yang "
"memilih asas, melakukan pencarian peringkat kuantum, kemudian mengira faktor"
" secara klasik daripada hasilnya.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "True/False: {#truefalse}"
msgstr "Benar/Salah: {#truefalse}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F The efficiency of Shor's algorithm threatens the security of RSA "
"encryption.\n"
msgstr "B/S Kecekapan algoritma Shor mengancam keselamatan penyulitan RSA.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F Shor's algorithm can be executed efficiently on any modern-day quantum "
"computer.\n"
msgstr ""
"B/S Algoritma Shor boleh dilaksanakan dengan cekap pada mana-mana komputer "
"kuantum masa kini.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F Shor’s algorithm uses quantum phase estimation (QPE) as a key "
"subroutine.\n"
msgstr ""
"B/S Algoritma Shor menggunakan penganggaran fasa kuantum (QPE) sebagai "
"subrutin utama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F The classical part of Shor’s algorithm involves calculating the greatest"
" common divisor (GCD).\n"
msgstr ""
"B/S Bahagian klasik algoritma Shor melibatkan pengiraan pembahagi sepunya "
"terbesar (GCD).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "T/F Shor’s algorithm only works for factoring even numbers.\n"
msgstr "B/S Algoritma Shor hanya berfungsi untuk memfaktorkan nombor genap.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"T/F A successful run of Shor’s algorithm always guarantees the correct "
"factors.\n"
msgstr ""
"B/S Satu jalankan algoritma Shor yang berjaya sentiasa menjamin faktor yang "
"betul.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Short answer: {#short-answer}"
msgstr "Jawapan pendek: {#short-answer}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Why is Shor’s algorithm considered a potential future threat to RSA "
"encryption?\n"
msgstr ""
"Mengapa algoritma Shor dianggap ancaman masa depan yang berpotensi kepada "
"penyulitan RSA?\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Why is finding the period, or order, of a modular exponential function "
"helpful for factoring a number in Shor’s algorithm?\n"
msgstr ""
"Mengapa mencari tempoh, atau peringkat, fungsi eksponen modular berguna "
"untuk memfaktorkan nombor dalam algoritma Shor?\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Challenge problems: {#challenge-problems}"
msgstr "Soalan cabaran: {#challenge-problems}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How many control qubits $m$ do we need for a given number $N$ that we're "
"trying to factor to obtain the precision in the QPE needed to find the "
"correct value of the order $r$?\n"
msgstr ""
"Berapa banyak qubit kawalan $m$ yang kita perlukan untuk nombor $N$ yang "
"cuba kita faktorkan bagi mendapatkan ketepatan dalam QPE yang diperlukan "
"untuk mencari nilai peringkat $r$ yang betul?\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Following the procedure we outlined here to factor 15, now try to factor "
"21.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mengikuti prosedur yang kita gariskan di sini untuk memfaktorkan 15, kini "
"cuba faktorkan 21.\n"
